# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Legacy URLs. Search Console reports these as "Not found (404)"; Google keeps
# re-crawling them because they still have inbound links.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The pre-Hugo blog used date-stamped permalinks under /blog/, e.g.
# /blog/posts/2022/01/13/fantastic-symbols-and-where-to-find-them. Slugs
# survived the migration unchanged, so the date segments can just be dropped.
/blog/posts/:year/:month/:day/:slug  /posts/:slug/  301
/blog/posts                          /posts/        301
/blog                                /posts/        301

# The `.Net` tag now lives at /tags/dotnet/. Hugo urlized `.Net` to
# `/tags/.net/` and Netlify drops dot-prefixed directories from the publish
# directory, so the old path 404'd while sitemap.xml still advertised it.
/tags/.net  /tags/dotnet/  301

